Disabling Auto-Configuration Classes:
-------------------------------------------
Let’s say we want to exclude the auto-configuration from loading.

We could add the @EnableAutoConfiguration annotation with exclude or excludeName
attribute to a configuration class:

@Configuration
@EnableAutoConfiguration(exclude={MySQLAutoconfiguration.class})
public class AutoconfigurationApplication {
    //...
}

We can also set the spring.autoconfigure.exclude property:

spring.autoconfigure.exclude=com.baeldung.autoconfiguration.MySQLAutoconfiguration
------------------------
Properties  → values
Auto-config → wiring
Runtime     → real effects
