How do you inspect JPA auto-configured beans?
I don’t rely only on /actuator/beans.
I use /actuator/conditions to understand which auto-configurations matched and why,
then inspect specific infrastructure beans like entityManagerFactory, transactionManager,
and repositories. For deep dives, I enable debug auto-config reports.
